# Assets

Placeholders to replace before you publish.

| File | Used for | Size |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `icon.png` | The app icon everywhere: Android launcher, iOS home screen, macOS Dock, Windows executable, installer and window, Linux menu, the web page's favicon. | Square PNG, 1024×1024. Keep the artwork inside the middle 80%: Android crops icons to a circle or rounded square. |
| `license.txt` (optional) | The license the Windows installer asks people to accept. Set `windows.installer.license = "assets/license.txt"` in `giode.toml`. | Plain text. |

Fonts, images and other files the app shows can live here too; embed them with
`//go:embed`, as `main.go` does with the icon.
